@startuml
title Outbox dispatch, retries, and privacy recheck
participant ExpenseUseCase
database Store
participant Dispatcher
participant Authorization
participant Provider
ExpenseUseCase -> Store: commit expense + recipient outbox rows atomically (required)
Dispatcher -> Store: claim pending message
Dispatcher -> Authorization: recipient still current member?
alt authorized
 Dispatcher -> Provider: deliver minimal notice (idempotency key)
 Provider --> Dispatcher: delivered / retryable failure
else removed or no longer authorized
 Dispatcher -> Store: suppress details; mark suppressed
end
note over Authorization: Detail link rechecks membership on every read.
@enduml
